{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04767","headline":"寄许八 · 张说","name":"寄许八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万类春皆乐，徂颜独不怡。\n年来人更老，花发意先衰。\n乳鹊穿坛画，巢蜂触网丝。\n平生美容色，宿昔影中疑。\n远道何由梦，同心在者谁。\n西风欲谁语，悯默遂无词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}